<p>You bought a new home. Everything is fresh, clean, under warranty. The last thing on your mind is gutter problems — those are for older homes with deferred maintenance, right?</p>

<p>Unfortunately, no. If you purchased a new construction home in Madison, Hampton Cove, Meridianville, or any of North Alabama's rapidly growing areas in the last five years, your gutters may already be failing — or about to.</p>
